---
config:
  theme: redux
description: >-
  one representative agentflow in the redux theme, the redux family (D152, D227): neo geometry and the shadow, no palette: a connector, a global refdoc, two open
  flows holding an input, a tool, a decision, a task and an action, a collapsed flow drawn as a
  card, and every link (sequence, labelled sequence, failure, reference)
---
agentflow-beta TB
  connector llm["LLM API"]

  global
    policy["Support Policy"]@{ shape: refdoc }
  end

  flow triage["Triage Agent"]
    ticket["ticket"]@{ shape: input }
    classify["classify_intent"]@{ shape: tool }
    severity["Severity?"]@{ shape: decision }
    ticket --> classify --> severity
  end

  flow resolve["Resolution Agent"]
    draft["draft_reply"]@{ shape: task }
    send["send_reply"]@{ shape: action }
    draft --> send
  end

  flow audit["Audit"]
    record["record_outcome"]@{ shape: task }
  end
  audit@{ view: "collapsed" }

  severity -->|"low"| resolve
  severity --x audit
  classify -.- policy
  resolve --> audit
